TnQxzdJyA9LJ4AL5rSI-MVqaHw&oe=69D12217"}, {"file_name": "OculusScreenshot1702168621.png", "id": "1417106885903761", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75222941_1417106889237094_8505880443188676782_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kOtr8dybcAYQ7kNvwFp2qNP&_nc_oc=Adq1HZq7KSzY2ihoPr5BaaguTd5UoYkCuPOVSquL3rUkcLRXNIvbM2i2Hy5HNNozUHA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afzdc0rT3e7E1MakDISdgRwOiyswo1erJmHWP0XJlj-NYQ&oe=69D10857"}, {"file_name": "OculusScreenshot1702169640.png", "id": "1024146142213818", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982441_1024146145547151_3805722331130364725_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ys-FD1ad9DAQ7kNvwHp0uuS&_nc_oc=AdrMGTHN9D-DHhR4G7UKJlMIuZ5SbDA01V2VG_JL3lXkyYvcwNNRqnfsROxAmoEc8QE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyXsVA6QEjoTT3R7jGE0udxoEPW1NGMFCEKMQmC1-thrg&oe=69D0FBD7"}, {"file_name": "OculusScreenshot1702168716.png", "id": "1045546456768821", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031557_1045546460102154_8869584294705848419_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jHZRG902s-8Q7kNvwEiLwSM&_nc_oc=Ado_4FaSmveq2WkSg8yIq-5lisOHUcuC_zhV9CsivgslSmarx7Zpra5HH4w7nYAhRVk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afwbry9YrtqIwGjYiInmrvLjBb6GeXiZtoEr2j8fAXoGiQ&oe=69D121D4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "OculusScreenshot1702169579.png", "id": "1421996451722456", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974657_1421996455055789_5575213174514540843_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bbXe5z154SwQ7kNvwGqXr0E&_nc_oc=AdqS5XPFOdApdNeXstIaB8zUKkVf4tfxyXpsLHgdY9ILrEZushJ8dcN0FVcBwIKN5YM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzdV0K3pz4peYfu_WvGHDrDVT4qN2PurPjP1AFzFHQy5g&oe=69D1191C"}, "display_name": "StarGateVR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "StarGateVR is a voice-driven VR tool for exploring astronomical data on Meta Quest.\n\n**Voice-controlled AI assistant:**\n- Query your loaded dataset by speaking naturally\n- Cross-match with multi-wavelength archives in a single command\n- Describe a new dataset and have it retrieved from the Gaia Archive automatically\n- AI features improve automatically with no app update required\n\n**Integrated archives:** Gaia DR3 \u00b7 eROSITA \u00b7 GALEX \u00b7 2MASS \u00b7 WISE \u00b7 SIMBAD \u00b7 MOCA\n\n**3D visualization:**\n- Map any parameters to spatial axes\n- Switch between physical coordinates, HR diagrams, and custom parameter spaces\n- Color and shade points by additional variables\n\n**Collaboration:**\n- Shared VR sessions with voice communication\n- Enriched datasets sync across all participants\n\n**Your data, your way:**\n- Import CSV, VOTable, or FITS formats\n- Export findings for follow-up in TOPCAT, astropy, or your own pipelines\n\nDesigned for researchers, educators, and advanced hobbyists.\n\nLooking for an educational introduction to 3D star mapping? Try **ConstellationsVR**, our entry-level experience with an AI astronomy guide for STEM learners and classrooms.\n\n**Note:** StarGateVR is a scientific research tool by Immersive Science LLC. It is not affiliated with the Stargate media franchise or the Stargate AI initiative.\n", "short_description": "Use VR to view, explore, analyze, and collaborate on multi-parameter Gaia Archive star data."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.immsci.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Immersive Science LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.immsci.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", 